WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.876
♪

00:00:00.959 --> 00:00:02.127
(gun shot)

00:00:02.211 --> 00:00:03.170
Dick:
I know what you're thinking.

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:05.005
♪

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:07.257
Dick: Who is this guy
with the incredible cheek bones?

00:00:07.341 --> 00:00:08.884
Where does he get his hair done?

00:00:09.468 --> 00:00:12.137
One day, I'll be
the most famous highwayman

00:00:12.221 --> 00:00:13.430
in all of England!

00:00:13.514 --> 00:00:16.517
You are literally
about to be hanged,

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:17.726
you idiot!

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:19.311
- (laughter)
- Dick: Quick note to my gang.

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:21.772
If you were planning a rescue,
now would be a good time.

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:22.856
- ♪
- (yells) 

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:24.691
- (gunshot)
- (yells)

00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:25.859
♪

00:00:25.943 --> 00:00:27.361
You've probably heard of me.
Dick Turpin?

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:28.529
New leader of the Essex gang?

00:00:28.612 --> 00:00:30.280
Nell:
Highwaymen murder and rob.

00:00:30.364 --> 00:00:31.365
You're not highwaymen, Dick.

00:00:31.907 --> 00:00:33.909
I've got this. We strike on three.

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:35.827
One, two…

00:00:35.911 --> 00:00:37.538
(horses running)

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:39.665
We'll get the next one.

00:00:39.748 --> 00:00:41.291
- ♪
- I've seen you prancing around

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:42.751
- in your funny shirts.
- (imitates gunshots)

00:00:42.835 --> 00:00:44.837
Dick: I'm new school, and
there's gonna be less violence

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:45.921
on my watch.

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:47.297
Is there anything
that I could've done

00:00:47.381 --> 00:00:49.091
to improve
your highway robbery experience?

00:00:49.174 --> 00:00:51.802
But we’re just as tough 
as any other gang in here.

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.887
Here’s your peppermint tea,
Dick.

00:00:53.971 --> 00:00:55.514
I put a splash of honey in it,

00:00:55.597 --> 00:00:56.890
I know you got
a scratchy throat.

00:00:56.974 --> 00:00:58.350
- Dick: Thanks, little Karen.
- ♪

00:00:58.433 --> 00:01:00.561
John: There’s only one man
brainless enough

00:01:00.644 --> 00:01:02.312
to steal from the syndicate.

00:01:02.396 --> 00:01:03.605
(mimics neck snapping) 

00:01:03.689 --> 00:01:04.982
- (laughs)
- Thank you, Dick.

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:06.358
I don’t know
what we’d do without you.

00:01:06.441 --> 00:01:08.026
♪

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:09.695
(yells)

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:11.196
♪

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:12.906
- (clicks)
- (screams)

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:15.617
♪

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:17.411
I’m gonna be famous!

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:20.247
- Dick Turpin!
- Dick Turpin.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:22.165
- Dick Turpin.
- Dick Turpin!

00:01:22.249 --> 00:01:23.458
Dick Turpin.

00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:26.753
I want this Dick in my hands 
as soon as possible.

00:01:26.837 --> 00:01:28.422
- (snickers)
- That sounds weird.

00:01:28.505 --> 00:01:30.382
Yeah, that did sound
a bit weird, sorry.

00:01:30.465 --> 00:01:33.677
♪

